WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.400
Recording a quick walkthrough on your Mac,

2
00:00:02.475 --> 00:00:03.725
with headphones on?

3
00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:06.525
The built-in recorder only hears your microphone.

4
00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:07.725
The video,

5
00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:08.100
the call,

6
00:00:08.138 --> 00:00:08.825
the music.

7
00:00:08.963 --> 00:00:10.450
All of it ends up silent.

8
00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:13.750
Screen & Sound Recorder captures your screen,

9
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.950
your computer's sound,

10
00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:15.700
and your voice,

11
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:17.225
headphones or not.

12
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.000
It lives right in your toolbar.

13
00:00:19.702 --> 00:00:20.627
Record your screen,

14
00:00:20.702 --> 00:00:21.752
or just your camera.

15
00:00:21.877 --> 00:00:23.527
Your microphone is already on.

16
00:00:23.665 --> 00:00:25.102
Turn on the camera too,

17
00:00:25.952 --> 00:00:27.077
and pick a quality.

18
00:00:27.779 --> 00:00:28.704
The first time,

19
00:00:28.804 --> 00:00:30.304
give your recordings a folder.

20
00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:33.204
Every video goes straight into it,

21
00:00:33.304 --> 00:00:34.529
inside Downloads.

22
00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:36.679
No save dialogs.

23
00:00:37.429 --> 00:00:38.629
Hit Start Recording,

24
00:00:39.654 --> 00:00:40.929
choose Entire Screen,

25
00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:42.154
switch on system audio,

26
00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:42.904
and share.

27
00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:45.204
Three seconds to get ready,

28
00:00:45.929 --> 00:00:47.029
and you're recording.

29
00:00:47.154 --> 00:00:48.529
Your camera floats on top,

30
00:00:48.604 --> 00:00:50.179
so drag it wherever it fits.

31
00:00:50.905 --> 00:00:52.905
Now just present like you normally would.

32
00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:55.030
The toolbar keeps the time as you go.

33
00:00:55.854 --> 00:00:56.779
Need a moment?

34
00:00:57.704 --> 00:00:59.154
Pause right from the toolbar,

35
00:00:59.254 --> 00:01:00.779
and pick up where you left off.

36
00:01:01.479 --> 00:01:02.029
When you're done,

37
00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.179
Stop & Save.

38
00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.618
Your recording lands in that folder as

39
00:01:05.618 --> 00:01:06.755
an MP4,

40
00:01:06.855 --> 00:01:08.580
and the Recordings page opens,

41
00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.655
ready to watch.

42
00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:11.254
Rename it,

43
00:01:12.704 --> 00:01:13.829
open it in QuickTime,

44
00:01:13.904 --> 00:01:15.154
or find it in Finder.

45
00:01:15.304 --> 00:01:16.854
The file follows along.

46
00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.105
Screen & Sound Recorder.

47
00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.405
Free on the Chrome Web Store.
